  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO Better Work</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Better Work Programme is a partnership between the UN&apos;s International Labour Organisation and the International Finance Corporation. The overall objective is to improve labour standards and at the same time competitiveness in global supply chains in developing countries with promotion of social dialogue between governments, the private sector and the unions as a key instrument. The Danish grant will support Better Work Strategic Phase III &quot;Improving the lives of millions of workers 2013-16&quot;. Special Danish priorities are (1) new Better Work Programme in Bangladesh and (2) development of an environment component in the Better Work Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
